OL,3,GNEWSAFrench navy in island pollution
OL,4,Atraining exercise
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe French navy is helping deliver an
OL,7,Fanti-pollution training exercise to
OL,8,Fhelp the bolster the island's readiness
OL,9,Ffor potential marine pollution
OL,10,Fincidents.
OL,12,FA specialist salvage and anti-pollution
OL,13,Fvessel, the Bourbon Argonaute will
OL,14,Fundertake an oil pollution response
OL,15,Fdrill with the Guernsey Ports Sarnia
OL,16,Fworkboat on Thursday morning.
OL,18,FThe vessel is equipped with specialist
OL,19,Fpollution response equipment such as
OL,20,Ffloating containment booms and systems
OL,21,Fcapable of recovering and treating oil
OL,22,Fat sea.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
