OL,3,GNEWSAFrench navy in island pollution
OL,4,Atraining exercise
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssistant harbour master Simon Granger
OL,7,Fsaid the exercise was an "important
OL,8,Fpart in maintaining Guernsey's
OL,9,Fpreparedness for maritime emergencies".
